{
  "name": "04 · Repeat-Order Reminder (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Sales)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 · Re-order Reminder\nRegular dawai khatam hone se 3 din pehle WhatsApp → customer re-order / visit book karta hai. Customer bhi khush, business ka repeat bhi.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Orders**: Name, Phone, Product, Start date, Days supply, Status (active).\n2. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID).\n3. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\nOnly for customers who agreed to WhatsApp reminders.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "74d7dbe2-510e-4381-a9b8-348af543e5b2",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 10,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "eadfe181-51dd-4d21-be46-cc52374c3de9",
      "name": "Daily 10 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Orders"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "Status",
              "lookupValue": "=active"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "7837d5cf-8552-4565-afc6-ce70e3a18158",
      "name": "Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// columns: Name, Phone, Product, Start date (yyyy-mm-dd), Days supply, Status\nconst out = [];\nfor (const { json: r } of $input.all()) {\n  if (!r.Phone || !r['Start date']) continue;\n  const end = DateTime.fromISO(r['Start date']).plus({ days: Number(r['Days supply'] || 0) });\n  const left = Math.round(end.diff($now.startOf('day'), 'days').days);\n  if (left === 3) out.push({ json: { ...r, days_left: left } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "ddd2fad1-c49b-4bbd-a2dc-7479b7408bc0",
      "name": "Running out soon?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short, friendly Hinglish WhatsApp (Roman script, max 3 lines) to {{ $json.Name }}: their {{ $json.Product }} will finish in {{ $json.days_left }} days. Ask if they want a re-order or a follow-up visit with the owner (reply REFILL or VISIT). Do NOT mention dose or medical advice. Sign: YOUR BUSINESS NAME.",
        "hasOutputParser": false
      },
      "id": "3561f32e-00a2-4313-8c7f-67c5df25c16e",
      "name": "AI writes reminder",
